{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55656","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十四 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万般惟道最堪依，一瞬荣枯万古悲。\n强笑低颜何忽忽，忘机绝虑自怡怡。\n潜龙终要投深浦，巢鸟应须占健枝。\n名利门中难立足，隐藏云水更何之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55656.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55656","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}